<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Request for SLA extension for case {!relatedTo.CaseId__r.CaseNumber}." recipientType="User" relatedToType="CaseSLA__c">
<messaging:htmlEmailBody >
<p>Dear {!recipient.Name},</p>

<p>I am writing to request an extension of the SLA for Case {!relatedTo.CaseId__r.CaseNumber}</p>
<p>The current SLA on Case is {!relatedTo.DueTime__c}, and we require additional time to address the issue comprehensively.</p>

<p>Please review the case details and approve the extension request at your earliest convenience.</p>

<p>Best Regards,</p>
<p>Modon Service Team</p>
</messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>